  <div class="legal-source">Scottish Government Model Private Residential Tenancy Agreement (April 2024) used as the clause-parity specification. The official statutory supporting notes are supplied separately.</div>
<p class="subtitle">Document ID: {{document_id}}<br>Generated: {{formatUKDate current_date}}</p>
